      "cooked": "<p>The Penultimate video of my first season of reviews is my most favorite game. Sentinels of the Multiverse! (video:&nbsp;http://t.co/H0urIfs4AB )</p><p>I have spent a great amount of time making content to express my love for this game and its message, or rather the message I glean from it. Not all of it has been great, see my Sinister Sentinels Series. However, my only ambition has been to get more people interested in this magnificent game and talking about it. And to that end, I have been successful.&nbsp;</p><p>Please share this video with those who are unfamiliar with this game we love. It is a simple explanation and overview of the product with opinions to help consumers decide if this game is for their shelf. This video is not a detailed synopsis and analysis of the inner workings of the lore/mythos/mechanics/design of the game.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, enjoy and thanks for watching.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
