      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nOne ouch found.End of turn effects are not resolved in order of player choice. &nbsp;Start and End of turn effects are resolved in the order the cards entered play.It is nice to see these mistakes in your videos because 90% of the time when I play a game I do something wrong.\n\n[/quote]\n\nScott &quot;Tox&quot; Morris and I were talking about that. He accused Christopher of the same misstep. I blame the amazingly engaging nature of the game. I&#39;m just a overwhelmed by the onslaught of awesome that I overlook a simple rule or math operation.\n\nI also have a very laid back attitude about games. You bought it, you play it the way you want. If that&#39;s by the book, go for it. If that&#39;s with home brews and variants, have a blast.&nbsp;\n\nWe usually kangaroo court what card would trigger first; &quot;Baron Blade would hit first he&#39;s mad at Legacy for Thoking him.&quot;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n",
